  'prompt.aerial-view.text': 'Use the photo I attached as the reference and re-shoot that exact same place and subject as a real drone photograph from high above: a steep top-down view, the floor or ground filling the frame, the subject small but clearly recognisable, and long soft shadows falling away from the light. Keep the colours and the light direction of my photo. A real drone photograph — not an illustration, not a map, not a miniature or tilt-shift effect.',
