  'prompt.80s-flashback.text': 'Using the photo I attached as the reference for my face, re-shoot it as a 1985 snapshot of the same person. Keep my identity, features, skin tone, age and pose recognisable — this is me in the eighties, not someone else. Style it for the era: voluminous permed hair, bright hoop earrings, a pink mesh top under an oversized faded denim jacket, sunglasses pushed up on my head, glossy warm-toned makeup. Take it the way a friend would have in that decade: direct on-camera flash, soft film grain, slightly warm and washed colour, and a red-orange date stamp reading 85 7 21 in the lower-right corner. No other text or watermark, no modern clothing or phones.',
  'prompt.caricature.title': 'Caricature',
  'prompt.caricature.description': 'A hand-drawn caricature that exaggerates what makes you you.',
  'prompt.caricature.text': 'Draw the person in the photo I attached as a hand-illustrated caricature. Exaggerate what makes them recognisable — the smile, the eyes, the hair — while keeping them clearly the same person, flattering rather than mocking. Loose confident ink line, warm flat colour, simple shading, a plain cream background, waist-up and facing the viewer. Not a photoreal portrait, no text, no watermark, no extra people.',
  'prompt.sketch.title': 'Sketch',
  'prompt.sketch.description': 'Turn your sketch into a finished artwork: the idea kept, the lines gone.',
  'prompt.sketch.text': 'Create an original artwork inspired by the sketch I attached. Preserve its subject, emotion and gesture — not its exact strokes or shapes. Boldly reimagine its forms, proportions, colours, materials and details: never trace or keep the original lines, and let their ideas live in the texture, the light and the colour instead. Wherever the sketch is simple, invent a richer interpretation. Style: a loose ink-and-watercolour study, bold washes, visible paper grain and warm limited colour. One finished piece, no text, no watermark, no frame.',
